const RESTORE_PROMPT='Restore the selected Tamil movie vinyl artwork conservatively. Isolate the complete sleeve from the scan background only where its outer edges are clear. Preserve every printed Tamil/English character, faces, credits and the whole composition. Return an exact 1:1 square with the sleeve filling the frame edge to edge. Remove the scanner/table background and perspective distortion; do not add padding, white margins or an outer frame. Crop to the printed sleeve edges. Preserve printed edge text; if a safe square cannot be produced without losing original content, flag it for review rather than silently cutting text. Repair visible wear without inventing lettering or missing artwork. Return each image separately, named Album - Front, Album - Back, Album - Side A or Album - Side B. Flag uncertain reconstruction. Return a high-resolution, high-quality image; Coverly will export square JPEG copies below 500 KB for embedding in music files; preserve image detail and leave final compression to Coverly. Wait for attached images, and preserve the originals.';
